{"id":"n62323-3-10","stage":1,"title":"생각나다 · 想念","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62323-3-10-1","ko":"오늘 저녁에 한잔 어때?","zh":"今天晚上一起喝点酒怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁에","audio":"/audio/adc9d30ae9de01c054e6.mp3"}},{"text":"한잔","meaning":"一杯，一盅","explanation":"한잔：一杯，一盅","readings":[{"term":"한잔","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72462","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한잔","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"b94a4dfc6a50694d","term":"한잔","zh":"一杯，一盅","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3","entryId":"72462","definition":"很容易就能喝一次的茶或酒。","pronunciation":["한잔"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e70f0864f05892ace98.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62323-3-10-2","ko":"좋지, 마침 소주 한잔이 생각나던 참이었는데.","zh":"好啊，我正好也想喝点烧酒呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋지,","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋지","audio":"/audio/93fe8dafc60040a28c9b.mp3"}},{"text":"마침","meaning":"正好，正巧","explanation":"마침：正好，正巧","readings":[{"term":"마침","audio":"/audio/4b10fb22324c4af9aef0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56109","senseId":"1","lemma":"마침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마침","audio":"/audio/4b10fb22324c4af9aef0.mp3"}},{"text":"소주","meaning":"韩国烧酒","explanation":"소주：韩国烧酒","readings":[{"term":"소주","audio":"/audio/f320904358d24bde45dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81672","senseId":"1","lemma":"소주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소주","audio":"/audio/f320904358d24bde45dc.mp3"}},{"text":"한잔이","meaning":"一个，同一；杯","explanation":"한：一个，同一；잔：杯；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"},{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17371","senseId":"3","lemma":"잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한잔이","audio":"/audio/0abe303a881471f20376.mp3"}},{"text":"생각나던","meaning":"想念，思念","explanation":"생각나다：想念，思念；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"생각나다","audio":"/audio/26998f80f524d39a07ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62323","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각나던","audio":"/audio/ce9126b338434e1ae6be.mp3"}},{"text":"참이었는데.","meaning":"刚……的时候","explanation":"참：刚……的时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71466","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참이었는데","audio":"/audio/2f6390cefa1f630d1304.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"4b10fb22324c4af9","term":"마침","zh":"正好，正巧","audio":"/audio/4b10fb22324c4af9aef0.mp3","entryId":"56109","definition":"很偶然地与某个机会或情况恰好吻合。","pronunciation":["마침"]},{"id":"f320904358d24bde","term":"소주","zh":"韩国烧酒","audio":"/audio/f320904358d24bde45dc.mp3","entryId":"81672","definition":"用谷物或红薯等酿的酒再蒸馏而得到的酒。","pronunciation":["소주"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个，同一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"同一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"ca06065856b9c29b","term":"잔","zh":"杯","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3","entryId":"17371","definition":"以盛饮料、酒等的器具为标准，数其数量的单位。","pronunciation":["잔"]},{"id":"26998f80f524d39a","term":"생각나다","zh":"想念，思念","audio":"/audio/26998f80f524d39a07ad.mp3","entryId":"62323","definition":"很怀念或很想做某事。","pronunciation":["생강나다"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"刚……的时候","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71466","definition":"做某事的情况或时候。","pronunciation":["참ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/aa256e93aeb63bf22a18.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.167,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62323","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7646,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天晚上一起喝点酒怎么样？","好啊，我正好也想喝点烧酒呢。","大家，黑板上的字看得清楚吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天晚上一起喝点酒怎么样？","好啊，我正好也想喝点烧酒呢。","大家，黑板上的字看得清楚吗？"],"answer":1}]}
